<p class="hero__deck">Industrial facilities must meet OSHA and IESNA illumination standards, which typically require 30 to 100+ footcandles depending on the precision of the manufacturing task. High-visibility 5000K LED lighting is standard for safety and quality control. From production floors and clean rooms to loading docks and hazardous areas — Archipelago Lighting delivers rugged, high-output LED solutions that survive where others fail.</p>
